WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.300
Lab 2 moves to a test
tenant, never production.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:06.525
You send the three log
categories to a test workspace,

3
00:00:06.525 --> 00:00:11.437
register a reader app with exactly the six
permissions, and run the check for real.

4
00:00:11.437 --> 00:00:15.887
Then the important step: paste the query
into the workspace and run it by hand,

5
00:00:15.887 --> 00:00:19.913
because an error that names a table
tells you the logs aren't arriving.

6
00:00:19.913 --> 00:00:22.487
After that you deploy
the reviewed template,

7
00:00:22.487 --> 00:00:26.313
sign in once with a test emergency
account, and watch the alert land.

8
00:00:26.313 --> 00:00:29.799
Record the drill, and the
ninety-day finding clears.

9
00:00:29.799 --> 00:00:31.340
Then back everything out.
